id: QUAL-070
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: Node.js callback error parameter ignored
category: quality
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
patterns:
  - regex: function\s*\(\s*err\s*,\s*\w+\s*\)\s*\{
    message: "Callback error parameter potentially ignored — always check err before using data"
fix: Always handle the error parameter first. if (err) return callback(err) or throw err.
